flowchart TD
  Start[Service startup] --> Config[Read service name and OTLP configuration]
  Config --> Enabled{Exporter configured?}
  Enabled -->|yes| Providers[Build trace, metric, and log providers]
  Enabled -->|no| Noop[Use disabled or no-op providers]
  Providers --> Runtime[Instrument operations and HTTP requests]
  Noop --> Runtime
  Runtime --> Shutdown[Flush providers on shutdown]
